###Block: Epic Alchemical Feats

Artillery	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Alchemical	PRESTAT:1,DEX=21	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Explosive Bomb	DESC:Your bomb range increment increases by 20 feet.	STACK:YES	MULT:YES	CHOOSE:NOCHOICE	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.38
Augmented Alchemy	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Alchemical	PRESTAT:1,INT=21	PRESKILL:1,Craft (Alchemy)=21	DESC:You can create alchemical items that are much more potent than normal. Creating augmented items increases the DC by 20 and the price by x5.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.38
Bomb Mastery	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Alchemical	PRESTAT:1,INT=27	PRESKILL:1,Knowledge (Arcana)=24	DESC:+1 to the save DC of all your bombs.	STACK:YES	MULT:YES	CHOOSE:NOCHOICE	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.38
Compound Bomb	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Alchemical	PRESTAT:1,INT=25	PRESKILL:1,Knowledge (Arcana)=24	DESC:You can apply two non-stacking bomb discoveries to a single bomb.	STACK:YES	MULT:YES	CHOOSE:NOCHOICE	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.38
Deadly Bomb	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Alchemical	PRESKILL:1,Knowledge (Arcana)=32	DESC:Creatures in splash range take full bomb damage instead of splash damage.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.39
Epic Extracts	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Alchemical	DESC:You gain access to the next level of extracts. Each time you take this feat, you gain access to one additional level of extracts (7th, 8th, 9th).	STACK:YES	MULT:YES	CHOOSE:NOCHOICE	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.39
Epic Mutagen	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Alchemical	PRESKILL:1,Craft (Alchemy)=25	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Grand Discovery ~ True Mutagen	DESC:Your mutagen grants +10 natural armor bonus and +10 alchemical bonus to Strength, Dexterity, and Constitution.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.39
Extract Bomb	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Alchemical	PRESKILL:1,Craft (Alchemy)=23	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Infusion	DESC:You can replace your bomb damage with the effects of an extract, delivering it as a bomb attack.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.39
Meta-Extract	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Alchemical	PRESTAT:1,INT=21	PRESKILL:1,Craft (Alchemy)=21	DESC:You can apply metamagic feats to your extracts.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.39
Meta-Extract Bomb	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Alchemical	PRESKILL:1,Craft (Alchemy)=27	PREABILITY:2,CATEGORY=FEAT,Extract Bomb,Meta-Extract	DESC:You can imbue your bombs with metamagic extract effects.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.39
Flawless Mutagen	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Alchemical	PRESKILL:1,Craft (Alchemy)=23	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Grand Discovery ~ True Mutagen	DESC:You suffer no mental ability score penalties when using your mutagen.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.39
Improved Bomb	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Alchemical	DESC:Your bomb damage increases by 1d6.	STACK:YES	MULT:YES	CHOOSE:NOCHOICE	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.40
Mutagen Bomb	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Alchemical	PRESKILL:1,Craft (Alchemy)=25	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Infuse Mutagen	DESC:You can create mutagen bombs that apply your mutagen effects to targets hit.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.40
Persistent Bomb	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Alchemical	PRESKILL:1,Craft (Alchemy)=24	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Sticky Bomb	DESC:Your bomb coats an area, persisting for a number of rounds equal to half your alchemist level.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.40
Poisoner	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Alchemical	PRESKILL:1,Craft (Alchemy)=25	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Poison Use	DESC:The DC of poisons you create or apply increases by 2.	STACK:YES	MULT:YES	CHOOSE:NOCHOICE	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.40
Prismatic Bomb	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Alchemical	PRESKILL:1,Craft (Alchemy)=25	DESC:You can create a bomb that functions as prismatic spray. Each time you take this feat, you can use it one additional time per day.	STACK:YES	MULT:YES	CHOOSE:NOCHOICE	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.40
